# Push a change to this file to run a backtest without the GitHub connector.
# Format: one line, "MODE [MONTHS]". Lines starting with # are ignored.
# The mode must also be in the fetch-step whitelist in backtest.yml, or it will
# silently get the short-history fetcher (see the v78bt note in CLAUDE.md).
#
# run 5: v80bt 36 (2026-09-19). Run 4 REFUTED my trail-floor hypothesis (the
# 'free' ladder came out WORSE, -0.155 vs -0.087, so that was not the cause).
# Run 5 tests the sharper suspect: MANAGEMENT RESOLUTION. Every historical
# backtest manages on 4h bars; a trade that banks 0.6R in hour 1 and dips back
# through entry in hour 3 of the same bar is never breakeven-stopped there, but
# the live bot polls every minute and would stop it. 2x2 grid: trail floor x 1h/4h.
v80bt 36
